      <package fileName="CCDASTROWorkflowManager-1.1.44.zip" sha1="de527b42b2dd1be5880cdcb2e9cc16eb0b9e52cc" type="script" releaseDate="20261013121612">
         <title>CCDASTRO Workflow Manager 1.1.44</title>
         <description>
            <p>Configurable PixInsight post-processing workflow manager.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>v1.1.44 fixes the PixInsight script-loading syntax error in the PCC HTTPS check, using a plain string prefix instead of a regular expression.</li>
               <li>The complete script loaded and constructed the workflow dialog in isolated native PixInsight testing. HTTPS acceptance, HTTP rejection, and all 22 regression scripts passed.</li>
               <li>Retains the v1.1.43 security changes: dynamic third-party source loaders are removed; SyQon and AutoDBE automation remain temporarily unavailable pending a supported secure execution path.</li>
               <li>Native process choices remain available. Security documentation is provided; dependency review and PTeam clarification remain open.</li>
            </ul>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
